silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_01_foundational_thesis_and_anchors_sections_06_cheese_trap_immunity_concrete_anchor_cheese_probe silm:hasExample "In 'CheeseProbeNode', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, The CheeseProbe is the adversarial query 'catus' — a bare string that lexically overlaps with Felis catus / TSN 183798 (a source leg into D_Mittens) but not with Mittens the cat (the colimit apex). The probe is designed to route the federation engine to the wrong object.." .
